      ],
      "source": "https://pagenweb.org/~clearfield/individual%20boroughs/mahaffey.html",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Mahaffey sits at the historic railroad junction where the New York Central & Hudson River line meets the Pennsylvania & Northwestern line.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahaffey%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The borough lies on the West Branch Susquehanna River, just downstream from the mouth of Chest Creek.",
